        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Crossref resolved Turing 1952, Schnakenberg 1979, Sumper 2002, Kröger 1999, Lenoci & Camp 2008, Gordon & Drum 1994, and Yendo & Akatsuka 1910 after OpenAlex returned HTTP 429. The gallery JPEG is SHA-256 pinned (499034f8…) and the CC BY 2.0 Wikimedia valve is pinned separately and labelled Arachnoidiscus sp. The reference JSON states that 242 nm is an assigned scale. Deducted because the Wikimedia image is not species-confirmed and OpenAlex itself did not return records." ;
